{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The devious Androliens have trapped the beloved superhero Beetle Roller inside a digital world, and it's up to you to help him escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race to the goal</strong> of each stage while <strong>posing fabulously!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746545981\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect\u00a0colorful orbs</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0grow your\u00a0Beetle\u00a0Ball gadget! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/Ball_Power.gif?t=1746545981\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And use your ball's power to <strong>squash your foes!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/Squash_Enemies.gif?t=1746545981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE BREAKDOWN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay inspired by a mashup of <i>Katamari</i>, <i>Monkey Ball</i>,<i> </i>and <i>Pizza Tower</i> with a <i>Kamen Rider</i> inspired protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vibrant and explosive art style inspired by anime and PS2 era games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 blood-pumping levels with 3 different aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 time ranks to collect in each level - can you get the fastest time? Prepare yourself for BEETLE ROLLER'S FINAL JUDGEMENT...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OUR STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GO! GO! Beetle Roller! was developed as a four-person student project at Eastern Michigan University. The game was created from scratch within an 9 week period.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/